.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Eval fixtures are regenerated by make_fixture.py; no need to version them.
*-workspace/fixtures/

# Throwaway artifacts produced inside eval runs (backups, rehearsal sandboxes).
*-workspace/**/outputs/*.tar.gz
*-workspace/**/outputs/rehearsal/
# Generated by skill-creator's generate_review.py from benchmark.json + grading.json.
*-workspace/**/review.html

# Eval run artifacts are a snapshot of one run; the harness above regenerates them.
*-workspace/iteration-*/
